\* All TLC check configs for AntflyMlGraphDagPasses.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyMlGraphDagPasses.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyCseMissDuplicate = FALSE
    BuggyCseNoConsumerRemap = FALSE
    BuggyDceDropReachable = FALSE
    BuggyDceNonTopoMap = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    CseRemapsConsumersOutputsAndParameters
    CseMapIsSemantic
    CseKeepsDataNodesDistinct
    CseGraphReferencesReachableNodes
    DceKeepsExactlyReachableNodes
    DceMapIsCompactTopological
    FinalGraphReferencesValid
    ParametersPreservedWhenReachable
    Safety

==== BadCseMissDuplicate
\* Expected-failure config: CSE misses an earlier semantically identical op.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyCseMissDuplicate = TRUE
    BuggyCseNoConsumerRemap = FALSE
    BuggyDceDropReachable = FALSE
    BuggyDceNonTopoMap = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    CseMapIsSemantic

==== BadCseNoConsumerRemap
\* Expected-failure config: CSE redirects a duplicate but leaves consumers
\* pointing at the old node IDs.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyCseMissDuplicate = FALSE
    BuggyCseNoConsumerRemap = TRUE
    BuggyDceDropReachable = FALSE
    BuggyDceNonTopoMap = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    CseRemapsConsumersOutputsAndParameters

==== BadDceDropReachable
\* Expected-failure config: DCE drops a reachable parameter while rebuilding.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyCseMissDuplicate = FALSE
    BuggyCseNoConsumerRemap = FALSE
    BuggyDceDropReachable = TRUE
    BuggyDceNonTopoMap = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    DceKeepsExactlyReachableNodes

==== BadDceNonTopoMap
\* Expected-failure config: DCE creates a compact id_map that violates the
\* original topological order.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyCseMissDuplicate = FALSE
    BuggyCseNoConsumerRemap = FALSE
    BuggyDceDropReachable = FALSE
    BuggyDceNonTopoMap = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    DceMapIsCompactTopological
